WEBVTT

01:41.830 --> 01:48.940
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.560 --> 01:51.930
[Episode 23]

02:04.870 --> 02:06.870
Get some sleep after drinking this.

02:08.360 --> 02:09.220
What about you?

02:10.520 --> 02:12.250
You haven't been back for days.

02:13.020 --> 02:14.880
I'll help tidy up your place a bit.

03:54.850 --> 04:02.820
[Quantum Entanglement]
[Parallel Universes]

04:23.540 --> 04:23.940
Hello?

04:24.810 --> 04:26.070
Can't find something?

04:26.190 --> 04:27.630
I can come over right away. I'm...

04:27.630 --> 04:28.770
You're amazing.

04:29.240 --> 04:30.100
My draft paper for calculating

04:30.100 --> 04:32.040
plasma turbulence,

04:32.360 --> 04:33.980
the one with the diagram

04:33.980 --> 04:35.420
drawn in green pen on the back,

04:35.420 --> 04:36.310
you actually put it

04:36.310 --> 04:38.970
with last week's
differential geometry notes.

04:39.310 --> 04:40.630
Your idea was spot on.

04:42.000 --> 04:43.510
Also, how did you think of putting

04:43.510 --> 04:46.040
Turing's biography and
Fermat's Last Theorem together?

04:46.040 --> 04:47.430
Your logic is so clear.

04:48.830 --> 04:51.270
It's much easier to find
than when I put them away myself.

04:51.270 --> 04:54.130
I'll never have to worry about
losing things again.

04:54.310 --> 04:55.159
I...

04:55.360 --> 04:56.120
Jiang Yubai,

04:56.430 --> 04:58.890
I think you're a genius at organizing.

04:59.750 --> 05:00.500
Gosh,

05:00.660 --> 05:03.120
this talent of yours
is so worth developing.

05:05.740 --> 05:07.650
I just put them there randomly.

05:08.190 --> 05:09.920
As long as it's convenient for you.

05:09.920 --> 05:11.500
It is, very convenient.

05:13.240 --> 05:14.220
Are you home?

05:16.430 --> 05:17.270
I...

05:22.070 --> 05:22.870
Yes, I'm home.

05:23.220 --> 05:23.750
Good.

05:24.830 --> 05:25.620
Thank you.

05:26.160 --> 05:26.820
Good night.

05:28.390 --> 05:29.070
Good night.

05:47.360 --> 05:47.950
Duan.

05:49.870 --> 05:52.630
Agent Tang, you're finally here.

05:52.830 --> 05:55.680
It's really hard to get
a meeting with you.

05:56.270 --> 05:57.120
Your favorites,

05:57.120 --> 05:58.430
I ordered them all for you.

05:58.430 --> 05:59.360
Go ahead and eat.

06:00.600 --> 06:02.860
Mr. Duan, you're really spending today.

06:02.950 --> 06:03.480
Isn't

06:04.190 --> 06:05.430
this very normal?

06:10.720 --> 06:11.750
Why do I feel like

06:11.750 --> 06:14.190
you're not here to eat,

06:14.720 --> 06:16.680
but to vent?

06:17.360 --> 06:18.830
Spit it out. What is it?

06:19.390 --> 06:20.920
What do I have to rant about?

06:21.430 --> 06:22.360
My mood

06:22.360 --> 06:24.560
is as beautiful as the weather today.

06:25.040 --> 06:27.060
I just suddenly wanted to have
a few drinks with you.

06:27.060 --> 06:27.520
Come on.

06:30.000 --> 06:30.620
All right.

06:30.830 --> 06:33.510
Whoever stops drinking first
today is a coward.

06:35.240 --> 06:36.960
That's the Tang I know.

06:37.070 --> 06:37.659
Come on.

06:38.720 --> 06:39.430
Wait.

06:41.720 --> 06:42.390
What?

06:42.390 --> 06:43.320
Get in the frame.

06:47.250 --> 06:47.980
Okay.

06:48.220 --> 06:49.280
Do I look handsome?

06:49.360 --> 06:50.040
Yes.

06:51.650 --> 06:53.140
[Photos and Videos]

06:53.230 --> 06:53.650
[Tang]

06:53.670 --> 06:54.680
[Post]

06:54.950 --> 06:57.810
Thank you, Mr. Duan, for the great treat.

06:59.070 --> 06:59.800
Let's drink.

06:59.830 --> 07:00.480
Cheers.

07:02.160 --> 07:03.040
Bottoms up.

07:09.630 --> 07:11.270
You really are a tough guy.

07:11.270 --> 07:12.510
No warm-up at all.

07:13.720 --> 07:15.130
I'll join you.

07:21.100 --> 07:21.700
Let's eat.

07:26.040 --> 07:27.630
What is it? Tell me.

07:30.310 --> 07:31.920
Why can't I just have

07:32.070 --> 07:34.360
some good food and drinks with you

07:34.480 --> 07:37.080
to strengthen
our revolutionary friendship?

07:38.270 --> 07:39.360
Oh, come on.

07:39.720 --> 07:43.520
You've been in business for so long.
Surely you've made new friends.

07:43.950 --> 07:47.680
You look like you're drinking your
sorrows away in dreary weather.

07:48.540 --> 07:49.180
No.

07:49.390 --> 07:51.190
I just knew you were craving hotpot,

07:51.190 --> 07:53.720
so I found a good restaurant
to share with you.

07:56.420 --> 07:57.220
Wait a minute.

08:00.690 --> 08:01.540
Hello, Su Mo.

08:01.660 --> 08:03.570
What's wrong? Aren't you at an audition?

08:03.570 --> 08:06.000
Tingting, it was supposed to be my turn,

08:06.540 --> 08:08.940
but Mr. Yang brought
a few more people over.

08:09.660 --> 08:11.370
The casting director told me to wait here.

08:11.370 --> 08:13.130
It's been quite a while.

08:13.300 --> 08:14.500
What should I do?

08:14.620 --> 08:15.540
What happened?

08:15.740 --> 08:17.450
Didn't you ask the people there?

08:17.450 --> 08:18.300
I asked.

08:18.690 --> 08:20.820
But they didn't give me a clear answer.

08:22.130 --> 08:23.570
Should I wait here

08:23.860 --> 08:24.980
or go in and ask?

08:26.250 --> 08:27.380
I'm coming over now.

08:27.860 --> 08:28.660
Leave it to me.

08:36.130 --> 08:37.169
Sorry, Duan.

08:37.409 --> 08:39.270
I have an emergency and need to go.

08:40.250 --> 08:41.980
It's your Su Mo again, isn't it?

08:42.169 --> 08:44.010
Why is he acting like a three-year-old

08:44.010 --> 08:45.870
and coming to you for everything?

08:46.460 --> 08:47.320
No.

08:47.860 --> 08:48.670
He's at an audition,

08:48.670 --> 08:51.330
and they're keeping him waiting
for a long time.

08:51.960 --> 08:53.480
Where's your professionalism?

08:53.480 --> 08:54.740
He's asking others for a favor,

08:54.740 --> 08:56.170
so waiting is to be expected.

08:56.170 --> 08:57.240
If he can't even stand this

08:57.240 --> 08:58.960
and calls for backup to play the victim,

08:58.960 --> 09:00.770
wouldn't that just make them
dislike him more?

09:00.770 --> 09:02.940
It's not easy for him
to get an opportunity.

09:02.940 --> 09:04.500
We can't just hand it over
to someone else.

09:04.500 --> 09:06.010
Besides, this is my job.

09:06.100 --> 09:07.120
I have to deal with it.

09:07.120 --> 09:09.320
That is what you call professionalism.

09:11.480 --> 09:12.210
I'm leaving.

09:19.740 --> 09:21.620
I'm confiscating
these two bottles of liquor

09:21.620 --> 09:23.950
so you don't drink yourself into a stupor.

09:31.840 --> 09:32.370
Fine.

09:33.770 --> 09:36.100
Tang Tingting, you are really something.

10:10.290 --> 10:11.220
I've handled it.

10:14.100 --> 10:16.160
We should drink our liquor together.

10:17.050 --> 10:17.770
Fill it up.

10:37.870 --> 10:38.600
You're here.

10:39.320 --> 10:40.250
I came to see you,

10:40.480 --> 10:42.270
and to bring you a toy.

11:02.000 --> 11:03.830
A binary star system model?

11:06.240 --> 11:07.100
Did you make it?

11:08.170 --> 11:09.600
It's so beautiful.

11:10.120 --> 11:10.920
Do you like it?

11:13.000 --> 11:14.800
It must have a lot of mechanisms.

11:24.790 --> 11:26.370
You put the emerald here?

11:30.030 --> 11:31.770
It's so pretty.

11:32.670 --> 11:34.130
It looks like an emerald.

11:35.120 --> 11:36.170
Any stone in your hands

11:36.170 --> 11:37.550
would become a gem.

11:40.360 --> 11:42.580
It must've been polished over time

11:42.870 --> 11:44.480
to have such a perfect shape.

11:46.670 --> 11:47.360
For you.

11:50.710 --> 11:51.790
Why give it to me?

11:52.360 --> 11:53.550
Because I want to.

11:57.720 --> 11:58.780
It's so beautiful.

11:59.120 --> 12:01.580
It's like the center
of a binary star system.

12:03.320 --> 12:05.630
Why don't you take a break
from studying this?

12:05.630 --> 12:07.030
You can do it another day.

12:07.440 --> 12:07.960
Um...

12:08.600 --> 12:10.520
You haven't tasted my cooking yet, right?

12:10.520 --> 12:12.650
I've had the vegetables you prepared.

12:12.740 --> 12:13.670
That's perfect.

12:13.720 --> 12:15.120
I must show you my skills.

12:15.130 --> 12:15.750
So...

12:16.400 --> 12:18.600
How about radish and beef brisket stew?

12:19.380 --> 12:20.440
You can also think about

12:20.440 --> 12:22.570
what you want to eat for the week ahead.

12:23.740 --> 12:25.260
No need to go through all that trouble.

12:25.260 --> 12:26.870
Cooking takes a long time.

12:26.870 --> 12:28.330
We can just order takeout.

12:28.390 --> 12:30.200
Takeout isn't as hygienic
as home-cooked food.

12:30.200 --> 12:30.860
Let me do it.

12:31.800 --> 12:33.000
Then what should I do?

12:33.600 --> 12:36.390
Just find something to do.

12:36.750 --> 12:38.350
I'll go buy groceries first.

13:17.720 --> 13:19.030
What's up? Hungry?

13:20.000 --> 13:20.620
No.

13:27.000 --> 13:27.730
Are you okay?

13:28.750 --> 13:29.550
I'm fine.

13:40.070 --> 13:41.130
Does it still hurt?

13:44.440 --> 13:45.900
Your leg isn't healed yet.

13:46.030 --> 13:48.360
Don't wander around.
Go back and sit down.

14:01.240 --> 14:02.360
Wait for me a bit longer.

14:02.360 --> 14:03.490
It'll be ready soon.

15:21.350 --> 15:24.680
Why did you put the vegetables in
after turning off the heat?

15:26.750 --> 15:28.000
Well, you have to

15:28.360 --> 15:29.960
let it simmer
with the heat off for a while.

15:29.960 --> 15:31.670
This is my secret recipe.

15:32.000 --> 15:34.400
It tastes good only when
simmered this way.

15:54.910 --> 15:55.710
What's wrong?

15:56.790 --> 15:57.550
I'm hungry.

15:57.960 --> 15:58.720
Hungry?

16:00.600 --> 16:01.820
It's almost done.

16:02.290 --> 16:02.940
Let's eat.

16:03.840 --> 16:04.640
Food is ready.

16:12.080 --> 16:13.240
It smells so good.

16:13.440 --> 16:14.580
It looks delicious.

16:15.630 --> 16:18.000
And it's my first time seeing two kinds

16:18.000 --> 16:19.240
of radishes in this dish.

16:19.240 --> 16:20.320
One is white radish,

16:20.320 --> 16:21.780
and the other is carrot...

16:21.870 --> 16:22.500
shreds.

16:24.840 --> 16:26.840
That's my secret recipe.

16:28.330 --> 16:29.150
Try it.

16:32.750 --> 16:33.510
I know.

16:33.510 --> 16:35.310
You must have done it on purpose.

16:36.910 --> 16:39.510
I saw you turn the heat down
really low just now.

16:39.600 --> 16:41.840
You definitely wanted me to taste it
when I'm the hungriest

16:41.840 --> 16:43.550
to enjoy your secret recipe.

16:46.030 --> 16:46.840
That's right.

16:47.600 --> 16:50.550
You have to turn off the heat and

16:50.550 --> 16:51.270
let it simmer

16:51.270 --> 16:53.030
to make it taste good.

16:56.840 --> 16:57.480
Is it good?

16:58.790 --> 16:59.850
It's so delicious.

17:02.270 --> 17:03.270
I'll try the beef.

17:09.000 --> 17:10.859
It's been stewed until it's so tender.

17:10.859 --> 17:12.450
That puzzle of yours

17:13.069 --> 17:14.569
is quite difficult, isn't it?

17:14.569 --> 17:15.790
It is quite hard.

17:15.960 --> 17:17.400
Why don't you help me with it

17:17.400 --> 17:18.730
after we finish eating?

17:19.510 --> 17:20.310
Okay.

17:33.350 --> 17:34.270
So good.

17:54.400 --> 17:55.460
You must be sleepy.

17:57.350 --> 17:58.160
No, I'm not.

18:01.030 --> 18:01.830
Then

18:02.420 --> 18:03.620
I'll head back first.

18:08.000 --> 18:09.400
Thank you for today.

18:09.750 --> 18:11.750
You stayed so late cooking for me.

18:13.270 --> 18:14.110
It's nothing.

18:14.760 --> 18:16.030
How are you getting back?

18:16.030 --> 18:16.880
It's so late.

18:17.000 --> 18:19.330
The buses have probably stopped running.

18:19.640 --> 18:20.960
I'll just take a taxi.

18:22.830 --> 18:24.510
That's too expensive.

18:28.270 --> 18:29.480
I mean,

18:36.070 --> 18:37.870
why don't you stay here tonight?

18:40.240 --> 18:42.350
That wouldn't be appropriate.

18:43.030 --> 18:44.400
Your brother will scold me again
if he finds out.

18:44.400 --> 18:45.730
Just don't let him know.

18:45.830 --> 18:47.550
I'm mainly worried it's unsafe
for you to go home alone.

18:47.550 --> 18:48.480
I'll get you a blanket so you can

18:48.480 --> 18:50.680
sleep on the floor here. How about that?

20:25.100 --> 20:28.600
[Hematology Department]

20:28.640 --> 20:30.240
Zeqiu, what brings you here?

20:31.200 --> 20:33.460
I came to process Lin Zhixia's discharge

20:33.480 --> 20:34.810
and have a chat with you.

20:35.510 --> 20:37.350
You could've just called me to do it.

20:37.350 --> 20:39.400
There was no need to make a special trip.

20:39.400 --> 20:41.070
Her hospitalization
has already troubled you a lot.

20:41.070 --> 20:42.070
I won't bother you

20:42.270 --> 20:43.800
with something so trivial.

20:44.350 --> 20:45.440
Don't be a stranger.

20:45.440 --> 20:46.500
We are all friends.

20:47.880 --> 20:49.580
How is Zhixia recovering?

20:50.000 --> 20:52.200
Pretty well. She's recovering nicely.

20:53.110 --> 20:54.590
Her leg still needs rest.

20:54.770 --> 20:55.830
Don't rush to walk.

20:56.180 --> 20:57.580
Avoid secondary injury.

20:58.880 --> 21:00.140
I'll remind her later.

21:02.590 --> 21:03.880
You've been working hard too.

21:03.880 --> 21:04.720
You had to work

21:04.720 --> 21:06.180
and take care of a patient.

21:06.720 --> 21:07.400
It's not hard.

21:07.400 --> 21:09.270
I've just been a bit busy lately.

21:10.200 --> 21:12.060
At the hospital, I have your help.

21:12.200 --> 21:13.030
As for Lin Zhixia,

21:13.030 --> 21:15.160
she has Jiang Yubai taking care of her.

21:22.310 --> 21:25.380
How are the two PhDs
I found for Zhixia last time?

21:25.640 --> 21:26.590
If they're no good,

21:26.590 --> 21:28.590
I can ask my mom to find someone else.

21:31.440 --> 21:32.750
I understand what you mean.

21:32.750 --> 21:33.550
But above all,

21:35.510 --> 21:37.050
Lin Zhixia said she doesn't need them.

21:37.050 --> 21:38.510
She can handle it herself.

21:42.310 --> 21:44.640
Doesn't she lack manpower and resources?

21:45.240 --> 21:46.210
These two people

21:46.590 --> 21:48.030
should be of great help.

21:48.350 --> 21:49.510
That's what I thought too.

21:49.510 --> 21:51.830
I asked both you
and Jiang Yubai about this.

21:51.830 --> 21:53.380
I thought your method

21:53.480 --> 21:54.830
was more effective

21:54.830 --> 21:55.880
and reliable.

21:58.000 --> 21:59.400
But maybe Jiang Yubai

22:00.550 --> 22:02.350
understands Lin Zhixia better.

22:04.400 --> 22:05.310
What did he say?

22:08.160 --> 22:10.220
He said Lin Zhixia doesn't need help,

22:10.400 --> 22:11.860
and she can do it on her own.

22:12.160 --> 22:13.720
I don't get it at all.

22:14.510 --> 22:16.170
Get back to work. I'm leaving.

22:24.920 --> 22:26.050
Of course it exists.

22:26.160 --> 22:27.830
The core parameters of the Drake equation

22:27.830 --> 22:29.830
mostly rely on subjective estimation.

22:29.830 --> 22:31.350
Even if we take relatively

22:31.350 --> 22:33.000
conservative values ​​
for these parameters,

22:33.000 --> 22:34.720
some calculation results still indicate

22:34.720 --> 22:35.480
that there are

22:35.480 --> 22:37.690
thousands of extraterrestrial
civilizations in the Milky Way.

22:37.690 --> 22:39.030
Equations are equations,

22:39.030 --> 22:40.490
and evidence is evidence.

22:40.510 --> 22:42.510
If there are so many
extraterrestrial civilizations,

22:42.510 --> 22:43.550
where are they?

22:43.640 --> 22:45.310
We haven't even found solid evidence

22:45.310 --> 22:47.110
of a single alien bacterium yet.

22:47.310 --> 22:49.570
Maybe the technological gap is too huge,

22:49.880 --> 22:51.160
just like how ants can't understand

22:51.160 --> 22:52.310
human radio waves,

22:52.550 --> 22:54.160
Alternatively, their life forms
may be completely different

22:54.160 --> 22:55.350
and unidentifiable to us.

22:55.350 --> 22:57.880
Or maybe the Great Silence
itself is a signal.

22:58.000 --> 23:01.200
An unprovable conjecture
is science fiction,

23:01.240 --> 23:02.310
not science.

23:02.350 --> 23:04.720
The spirit of science lies in
exploring the unknown.

23:04.720 --> 23:05.790
Project Ozma,

23:05.810 --> 23:08.000
a "Search for
Extraterrestrial Intelligence" project,

23:08.000 --> 23:10.480
is exactly using scientific methods
to find evidence.

23:10.480 --> 23:11.920
You can't assert that they don't exist

23:11.920 --> 23:14.120
just because we haven't found them yet.

23:14.220 --> 23:14.920
Okay.

23:15.240 --> 23:17.160
Okay, I lose.

23:17.550 --> 23:20.200
It's mainly because I also
truly believe that aliens exist.

23:20.200 --> 23:21.800
Alas, I drew the opposition.

23:22.160 --> 23:23.440
Giving up already?

23:23.680 --> 23:24.510
Let's play a little longer.

23:24.510 --> 23:25.790
The winner is decided.

23:25.880 --> 23:26.890
I'm going to sleep.

23:26.890 --> 23:28.510
Let's play a little longer.

23:28.510 --> 23:29.570
I'm going to sleep.

23:30.460 --> 23:32.590
Play with me a little longer.

23:32.790 --> 23:33.850
It's time to sleep.

23:35.110 --> 23:35.920
Jiang Yubai.

23:37.790 --> 23:38.810
Jiang Yubai!

23:41.510 --> 23:42.960
Jiang Yubai, wake up.

23:43.270 --> 23:44.400
Jiang Yubai,

23:44.640 --> 23:46.300
stop pretending to be asleep.

23:47.000 --> 23:48.240
Jiang Yubai, wake up.

23:48.270 --> 23:48.870
Wake up...

24:15.450 --> 24:16.510
Are you hurt?

24:19.640 --> 24:20.270
No.

24:22.920 --> 24:23.920
Let me help you up.

24:31.590 --> 24:32.400
I'll...

24:33.790 --> 24:34.720
Have some water.

25:31.440 --> 25:32.240
Dr. Shen.

25:34.310 --> 25:36.970
What's with the brooding
handsome guy act here?

25:38.330 --> 25:39.260
Why are you here?

25:41.050 --> 25:42.380
It's too stuffy inside.

25:49.770 --> 25:50.900
Look at you.

25:51.220 --> 25:52.810
You look more like a patient

25:52.900 --> 25:54.830
than those of us undergoing chemo.

25:56.180 --> 25:57.810
Could it be...

25:58.610 --> 25:59.530
A breakup?

26:06.660 --> 26:07.390
Not exactly.

26:08.590 --> 26:09.440
It's just...

26:12.160 --> 26:13.110
A friend of mine.

26:15.880 --> 26:17.110
He likes a girl,

26:19.200 --> 26:20.160
but she seems to

26:22.160 --> 26:24.420
already have feelings for someone else.

26:25.480 --> 26:26.340
He's wondering

26:29.960 --> 26:31.070
if he should let go.

26:37.140 --> 26:38.530
You healthy people

26:38.900 --> 26:40.760
really have nothing better to do.

26:43.380 --> 26:44.420
Here I am,

26:45.330 --> 26:48.660
wondering every day how to survive
the next treatment cycle

26:49.850 --> 26:51.980
and whether I'll live to see tomorrow.

26:53.530 --> 26:54.330
As for you,

26:55.290 --> 26:56.550
you are perfectly fine

26:57.030 --> 26:58.550
and have plenty of time.

26:59.290 --> 27:00.690
You can love many people,

27:01.070 --> 27:02.200
eat many meals,

27:02.880 --> 27:04.140
and make many friends.

27:05.720 --> 27:07.920
Just because someone doesn't like you,

27:08.000 --> 27:09.530
you're moping around here.

27:11.070 --> 27:13.070
What do you have to be unhappy about?

27:13.940 --> 27:17.270
What you have is something
we wouldn't even dare to dream of.

27:19.010 --> 27:19.810
Besides,

27:20.290 --> 27:21.820
even if you can't be lovers,

27:22.180 --> 27:24.290
you can still be friends or family.

27:25.530 --> 27:28.390
There's no need to act like
it's the end of the world.

27:35.660 --> 27:37.250
Get over it soon, Dr. Shen.

27:38.090 --> 27:39.490
Don't waste your energy.

27:40.940 --> 27:41.980
I'm still counting on you

27:41.980 --> 27:43.900
to treat me in high spirits.

28:23.730 --> 28:28.180
[Class Break]

28:36.720 --> 28:40.390
[Class Break]

28:39.700 --> 28:40.480
Everyone.

28:45.200 --> 28:48.220
[Class Break]

28:46.590 --> 28:48.380
Are you guys free this weekend evening?

28:48.380 --> 28:50.030
It's been a long time
since our last gathering.

28:50.030 --> 28:50.700
My treat.

28:51.200 --> 28:52.140
Let's hang out.

28:53.680 --> 28:54.740
Am I seeing things?

28:54.740 --> 28:56.700
Dr. Shen is actually
organizing a gathering?

28:56.700 --> 28:57.740
What a rare sight.

28:58.110 --> 29:00.330
Plus one. The sun is rising from the west.

29:00.330 --> 29:02.350
Did something trigger you, Dr. Shen?

29:02.350 --> 29:04.550
Shen Fuxuan,
are you finally done with work?

29:04.550 --> 29:05.160
Yes.

29:05.310 --> 29:06.340
Bad timing, bro.

29:06.400 --> 29:08.140
I have to oversee an offline promotion
this weekend.

29:08.140 --> 29:08.850
I can't get away.

29:08.850 --> 29:12.090
One of my artists has a sudden
schedule... I'm so miserable.

29:12.090 --> 29:13.030
I'm free.

29:13.380 --> 29:14.160
But...

29:14.330 --> 29:15.940
I can't go out with my injury.

29:19.200 --> 29:21.590
Me too. I still have
a few orders to finish.

29:23.240 --> 29:25.250
It's okay. Let's meet next time.

29:25.920 --> 29:26.400
Wait.

29:26.940 --> 29:28.680
We might be absent,
but the drinks shouldn't be.

29:28.680 --> 29:29.510
Since you asked,

29:29.510 --> 29:30.770
we can't just let it go.

29:31.000 --> 29:32.220
Let's hang out online right now.

29:32.220 --> 29:34.090
Your treat. Have food and drinks delivered

29:34.090 --> 29:34.700
to everyone.

29:34.700 --> 29:36.760
We'll drink together on a video call!

29:42.190 --> 29:43.290
I don't mind.

29:43.460 --> 29:45.890
I agree. Dr. Shen's treat.

29:47.570 --> 29:49.010
Thank you, Dr. Shen.

29:50.070 --> 29:52.800
By the way, order
strawberry milk for Lin Zhixia.

29:54.770 --> 29:56.300
You don't need to remind me.

29:59.110 --> 30:01.300
Alright, online hangout it is.

30:01.440 --> 30:03.950
Send me what you want to eat,
and I'll order for us.

30:03.950 --> 30:04.350
[Cold beer, BBQ, beef, mutton]

30:04.370 --> 30:04.730
[Grilled shrimp, grilled squid,
grilled vegetables]

30:04.730 --> 30:05.530
[Plum wine, fried chicken,
fries, tteokbokki]

30:05.560 --> 30:06.250
[Plum wine, fried chicken,
fries, tteokbokki]

30:06.280 --> 30:06.750
[Soda, BBQ, beef, mutton]

30:06.780 --> 30:07.220
[Grilled shrimp, grilled squid,
potato slices, grilled vegetables]

30:07.270 --> 30:07.670
[No. 1092, Dongyue East Road,
Binjiang District]

30:07.690 --> 30:08.130
[Fun Biking Co., Ltd.]

30:08.150 --> 30:08.530
[No. 1080, Wenrui Road, Jiang District]

30:08.560 --> 30:08.990
[Star Shine Media Co., Ltd.]

30:09.010 --> 30:09.640
[Strawberry milk, chips,
cookies, prawn crackers]

30:09.680 --> 30:10.160
[Recipient: Tang Tingting]

30:10.180 --> 30:10.550
[Address: No. 1080 Wenrui Road,
Jiang District, Huacheng City]

30:10.580 --> 30:11.090
[Star Shine Media Co., Ltd.]

30:12.980 --> 30:13.920
Eight bottles.

30:14.570 --> 30:14.990
[Recipient: Lin Zhixia]

30:15.010 --> 30:15.400
[Address: Binjiang District,
Huacheng City]

30:15.430 --> 30:16.110
[Room 503, Building 2, Qingbei University]

30:16.830 --> 30:17.830
Strawberry milk.

30:30.350 --> 30:31.350
Everyone is here.

30:32.550 --> 30:33.480
Long time no see.

30:34.200 --> 30:35.660
Let me say a few words first.

30:35.660 --> 30:36.270
Here,

30:36.850 --> 30:38.640
let us first celebrate

30:38.640 --> 30:40.160
the success of Mr. Shen's

30:40.480 --> 30:42.790
first-ever hangout organization.

30:43.200 --> 30:45.070
Although this method is a bit cyberpunk,

30:45.070 --> 30:45.850
it doesn't matter.

30:45.850 --> 30:48.160
Come on, let's make a toast, shall we?

30:48.440 --> 30:48.920
Cheers.

30:48.920 --> 30:49.680
Cheers.

30:49.680 --> 30:51.920
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

30:54.030 --> 30:54.940
Shen Fuxuan,

30:55.240 --> 30:57.000
let me toast you individually.

30:57.700 --> 30:59.110
Thank you, Dr. Shen,

30:59.270 --> 31:01.720
for taking care of me
during my hospitalization.

31:01.720 --> 31:02.270
Cheers.

31:03.310 --> 31:04.830
But I can only drink milk.

31:04.830 --> 31:07.030
You don't have to drink the whole glass.

31:08.420 --> 31:09.880
Dr. Shen, you're such a good drinker.

31:09.880 --> 31:11.480
Zhixia really has some pull.

31:12.290 --> 31:13.510
Don't let me drink alone.

31:13.510 --> 31:14.700
Let's all toast together.

31:14.700 --> 31:16.110
We shouldn't just drink.

31:16.110 --> 31:17.110
Let's play a game.

31:18.010 --> 31:19.880
Does Mr. Duan have any brilliant ideas?

31:19.880 --> 31:21.610
You guys play. I'll just watch.

31:21.720 --> 31:23.070
Come on, let's play...

31:24.430 --> 31:25.360
Fifteen Twenty.

31:25.510 --> 31:26.510
The two of us can start first.

31:26.510 --> 31:28.170
Bring it on. I'll bet 100 cups.

31:28.220 --> 31:28.960
Come on.

31:29.030 --> 31:29.830
15, 20, 10.

31:30.220 --> 31:31.160
15, 20, 15.

31:31.900 --> 31:32.300
Drink.

31:32.720 --> 31:33.980
Hurry up and drink now.

31:34.940 --> 31:36.390
-15, 20, 10.
-15, 20, 15.

31:36.960 --> 31:38.440
-15, 20, 20.
-15, 20, 5.

31:38.810 --> 31:39.340
Drink up.

31:39.670 --> 31:41.000
You've got some skills.

31:41.620 --> 31:43.380
15, 20, 5.

31:44.230 --> 31:45.400
15, 20, 10.

31:46.480 --> 31:47.340
You lost again.

31:48.400 --> 31:49.060
Bottoms up.

31:50.240 --> 31:52.190
Rock, paper, scissors.

31:52.530 --> 31:53.270
It's okay.

31:53.270 --> 31:53.960
Go, Jiang.

31:53.960 --> 31:54.360
Again.

31:55.590 --> 31:57.770
-Rock, paper, scissors.
-Rock, paper, scissors.

31:57.770 --> 31:59.520
You are no good either. Drink.

32:00.860 --> 32:02.020
Jiang is no good.

32:02.420 --> 32:04.030
Zhixia, it's all up to you.

32:04.620 --> 32:07.150
I only know how to play
rock, paper, scissors.

32:08.010 --> 32:09.740
Rock, paper, scissors is fine.

32:11.530 --> 32:12.860
Rock, paper, scissors.

32:13.960 --> 32:16.230
-Rock, paper, scissors.
-Rock, paper, scissors.

32:16.230 --> 32:16.960
Beautiful.

32:17.880 --> 32:18.680
I lost.

32:19.240 --> 32:21.200
Zhixia, it has to be you.

32:21.200 --> 32:22.200
Bottoms up for me.

32:31.250 --> 32:33.270
Duan Qiyan, are you drunk?

33:27.350 --> 33:28.080
Hello, Zhou.

33:29.460 --> 33:30.240
Shen Fuxuan,

33:30.980 --> 33:33.140
regarding the matter
you asked me to look into,

33:33.140 --> 33:34.470
there is some progress.

33:34.920 --> 33:37.480
Our college does have a cutting-edge

33:37.480 --> 33:40.220
gene-editing research project
on blood disorders.

33:40.220 --> 33:41.010
Recently,

33:41.110 --> 33:43.110
it just received ethical approval.

33:43.400 --> 33:44.590
They are searching globally

33:44.590 --> 33:46.850
for rare cases with high compatibility.

33:47.440 --> 33:49.610
The case you sent me a while ago

33:49.830 --> 33:51.590
is quite a good match.

33:53.050 --> 33:53.550
Really?

33:56.200 --> 33:58.480
But I have to be upfront.

33:59.010 --> 34:00.510
This treatment is too new,

34:00.720 --> 34:02.450
and the risk is extremely high.

34:02.480 --> 34:03.830
The current estimated survival rate

34:03.830 --> 34:05.900
is only about 10 to 20 percent.

34:06.590 --> 34:08.800
Frankly speaking, it's a huge gamble.

34:09.630 --> 34:10.560
10 to 20 percent?

34:10.920 --> 34:13.670
Yes, and that's the best-case scenario.

34:14.480 --> 34:15.090
Dr. Shen,

34:15.480 --> 34:17.860
Shui's preliminary evaluation
results are out.

34:17.860 --> 34:19.520
Things are not looking great.

34:19.550 --> 34:21.090
The bone marrow aspiration results show

34:21.090 --> 34:22.550
that her response
to the first-line intensive regimen

34:22.550 --> 34:23.280
is very poor.

34:24.210 --> 34:26.360
The tumor burden
didn't decrease as expected,

34:26.360 --> 34:28.219
and some indicators even went up.

34:29.170 --> 34:30.590
The director just reviewed it.

34:30.590 --> 34:31.800
He said that

34:33.130 --> 34:34.230
in the short term,

34:34.460 --> 34:36.820
we're out of effective standard treatment

34:36.820 --> 34:37.550
options.

34:48.260 --> 34:48.800
Zhou,

34:49.440 --> 34:51.050
please send all relevant materials,

34:51.050 --> 34:52.800
detailed project data, potential risks,

34:52.800 --> 34:54.420
and all data on the success rates,

34:54.420 --> 34:55.460
to me in the most detailed

34:55.460 --> 34:56.920
and unvarnished version.

34:57.860 --> 34:59.660
I will evaluate them carefully.

35:00.150 --> 35:00.650
Okay.

35:35.110 --> 35:35.550
Hello?

35:35.900 --> 35:36.710
Listen to me first.

35:36.710 --> 35:37.770
It's an emergency.

35:37.940 --> 35:39.030
My parents are making a surprise visit.

35:39.030 --> 35:40.090
They said they're almost downstairs

35:40.090 --> 35:41.550
and will be coming up soon.

35:43.150 --> 35:44.480
Don't panic.

35:44.480 --> 35:45.540
I'll be right back.

35:46.650 --> 35:47.670
Help me ask for leave.

35:47.670 --> 35:48.330
Sure thing.

35:51.480 --> 35:52.150
Dad, Mom.

35:52.420 --> 35:53.500
This is Lin Zeqiu.

35:54.460 --> 35:55.660
Hello, Sir and Ma'am.

35:56.550 --> 35:57.810
Come in and have a seat.

36:08.230 --> 36:09.320
Dad, you...

36:10.130 --> 36:12.130
Mom, that's the bedroom over there.

36:16.880 --> 36:18.610
Would you like some water, Sir?

36:52.230 --> 36:52.960
Sir,

36:53.360 --> 36:53.880
Ma'am,

36:54.550 --> 36:56.150
please have a glass of water.

36:59.610 --> 37:02.140
What is the relationship
between you two now?

37:04.030 --> 37:05.500
Sir, we...

37:05.500 --> 37:06.700
This is my boyfriend.

37:10.530 --> 37:11.730
We live together now.

37:14.050 --> 37:14.860
Jin Baihui.

37:16.010 --> 37:17.670
How can you say that?

37:23.980 --> 37:26.380
Is this the result
of your years of studying

37:26.440 --> 37:28.070
and education?

37:32.320 --> 37:33.920
Let's go. We'll talk at home.

37:33.920 --> 37:34.850
I'm not leaving.

37:35.210 --> 37:36.050
Hurry up and let's go.
We'll talk when we get back.

37:36.050 --> 37:38.310
If you have something to say, say it here.

37:42.130 --> 37:44.790
I don't want to scold you
in front of an outsider.

37:46.420 --> 37:48.020
Lin Zeqiu is not an outsider.

37:50.050 --> 37:51.710
You can say whatever you want.

37:56.900 --> 37:58.760
You think you're all grown up now?

37:59.050 --> 38:01.510
My words don't mean anything
to you anymore?

38:04.280 --> 38:04.610
Fine.

38:05.550 --> 38:06.880
Then let me ask you this.

38:07.710 --> 38:08.920
You just moved in with him

38:08.920 --> 38:10.320
without a proper status?

38:10.610 --> 38:12.070
Where is your upbringing?

38:17.110 --> 38:19.040
You rented this place, didn't you?

38:19.960 --> 38:21.690
And it's in such a remote place.

38:22.320 --> 38:24.180
What kind of life can you give her?

38:26.670 --> 38:28.800
What kind of life can he give you?

38:29.260 --> 38:31.190
He has no house and no car.

38:32.610 --> 38:34.410
Is this the life you want to live?

38:36.050 --> 38:36.710
Sir.

38:37.440 --> 38:38.320
I have a job.

38:38.900 --> 38:40.140
I can take good care of my family.

38:40.140 --> 38:41.580
What can you take care of?

38:41.860 --> 38:44.090
She could have had a better life!

38:44.160 --> 38:45.180
Because of you,

38:45.210 --> 38:46.710
she has to suffer with you!

38:47.150 --> 38:48.050
Is this what you call taking care of her?

38:48.050 --> 38:48.860
Dad, stop it.

38:50.780 --> 38:52.380
I've already made up my mind.

38:53.000 --> 38:54.800
No matter what the future holds,

38:55.280 --> 38:56.420
I will be with him.

38:57.010 --> 38:58.210
-You...
-Jin Baihui.

39:00.500 --> 39:02.010
Just keep being stubborn.

39:03.650 --> 39:04.850
The days of suffering

39:05.500 --> 39:06.550
are yet to come!

39:36.340 --> 39:37.070
Don't be sad.

39:37.800 --> 39:39.000
Didn't we agree

39:40.340 --> 39:43.270
to make your parents believe
we're really together?

39:44.130 --> 39:45.590
I guess it's a success now.

39:54.110 --> 39:54.760
I'm sorry

39:55.860 --> 39:57.720
that you got scolded and wronged.

39:58.630 --> 39:59.230
It's fine.

40:00.360 --> 40:01.490
I'm thick-skinned.

40:01.800 --> 40:02.440
It's okay.

40:04.630 --> 40:06.560
We're just helping each other out.

40:07.730 --> 40:09.130
Bros help each other out.

40:12.860 --> 40:13.460
Thank you.

40:30.640 --> 40:33.710
[Huacheng City Hejia Hospital]
[Hematology Department Ward]

40:42.230 --> 40:44.630
You've been doing well
these past two days.

40:45.170 --> 40:46.970
The nurses all praised you to me.

40:55.860 --> 40:57.190
This is a reward for you.

40:58.210 --> 40:59.340
Thank you, Dr. Shen.

41:15.480 --> 41:17.140
Since I've been doing so well,

41:17.480 --> 41:18.300
Dr. Shen,

41:19.550 --> 41:21.210
could you take a photo with me?

41:21.400 --> 41:22.730
The hospital has rules.

41:23.280 --> 41:24.810
No taking photos together.

41:25.170 --> 41:26.230
Just one.

41:26.880 --> 41:28.480
I lost a bet with my besties.

41:28.860 --> 41:31.460
They all took photos
with their math teachers,

41:31.550 --> 41:33.280
and I'm the only one who didn't.

41:41.880 --> 41:43.680
Absolutely no photos together.

41:47.480 --> 41:49.080
But you can take a photo of me.

41:50.980 --> 41:52.130
Just don't include
this equipment in the shot.

41:52.130 --> 41:52.940
That works.

41:53.590 --> 41:54.850
Dr. Shen, stand still.

42:06.260 --> 42:07.130
Smile a little.

42:09.300 --> 42:10.630
Strike a handsome pose.

42:11.090 --> 42:12.090
Make a peace sign.

42:14.840 --> 42:16.780
Three, two, one.

42:17.210 --> 42:18.110
Cheese!

42:26.820 --> 42:28.620
Is something on your mind today?

42:32.750 --> 42:34.350
But you still look handsome.

42:42.840 --> 42:44.640
I shouldn't have agreed to this.

42:52.550 --> 42:54.440
Turn off the light and go to sleep.

43:38.150 --> 43:39.800
This therapy is too new.

43:39.800 --> 43:41.330
The risk is extremely high.

43:41.610 --> 43:43.150
The current estimated survival rate

43:43.150 --> 43:45.110
is only a little over ten percent.

44:28.340 --> 44:30.550
To put it bluntly, this is a huge gamble.

44:37.940 --> 44:40.180
Shui, are you asleep?

44:41.350 --> 44:42.150
Wait a moment.

45:01.090 --> 45:01.550
Come in.

45:03.080 --> 45:06.600
[Huacheng City Hejia Hospital]
[Hematology Department Ward]

45:16.820 --> 45:17.460
Shui.

45:18.760 --> 45:20.890
I have to tell you something right now,

45:21.110 --> 45:22.570
something very important

45:22.610 --> 45:23.800
and serious.

45:26.340 --> 45:27.340
After you hear it,

45:28.460 --> 45:29.590
the choice is yours.

45:53.800 --> 45:54.730
Why are you here?

45:55.570 --> 45:57.030
I'm here to visit you.

45:57.900 --> 45:58.780
Seriously...

45:58.780 --> 46:00.800
I've been extremely busy lately.

46:01.670 --> 46:03.050
Currently, our company

46:03.050 --> 46:04.840
is increasingly expanding.

46:05.210 --> 46:07.480
I have to split myself
in two to handle it.

46:08.010 --> 46:09.420
Stop putting on airs.

46:09.420 --> 46:10.800
If your business is expanding,

46:10.800 --> 46:12.530
why don't you hire more people?

46:13.760 --> 46:15.820
This is the excellent quality
of a good boss

46:15.820 --> 46:18.000
who handles things personally.

46:19.190 --> 46:20.280
Show-off.

46:20.710 --> 46:22.040
Drink it while it's hot.

46:22.550 --> 46:23.690
I have to say,

46:25.110 --> 46:28.230
this coffee came right on time.

46:28.340 --> 46:30.130
I was really too sleepy.

46:31.860 --> 46:33.190
What good stuff is this?

46:33.460 --> 46:34.820
Your favorite.

46:38.130 --> 46:39.960
I can always count on you, Tang.

46:42.530 --> 46:43.530
Let me take a call.

46:48.670 --> 46:50.730
Don't dawdle. Just say it.

46:53.980 --> 46:54.820
Speak.

46:58.320 --> 46:59.860
No, how many times do I have to say it?

46:59.860 --> 47:01.390
Stop trying to persuade me.

47:01.760 --> 47:04.290
I think this issue
is not important right now.

47:04.630 --> 47:06.530
Everything has its priorities.

47:06.650 --> 47:08.530
You think your problem
is the most important now,

47:08.530 --> 47:09.440
but it's exactly the opposite.

47:09.440 --> 47:12.370
I think a technological upgrade
is the top priority.

47:14.730 --> 47:15.860
Unbelievable.

47:17.300 --> 47:18.460
What's wrong?

47:18.500 --> 47:19.560
Why the big temper?

47:20.590 --> 47:22.550
This company is full of crap.

47:22.550 --> 47:24.880
I don't even know
why I hired these people.

47:30.190 --> 47:32.030
Duan Qiyan, I don't mean to criticize you,

47:32.030 --> 47:33.900
but can you be a little more patient?

47:33.900 --> 47:36.300
You've had this bad habit since childhood.

47:36.400 --> 47:37.840
There's a problem
with your communication style.

47:37.840 --> 47:40.170
How can you negotiate anything like this?

47:40.440 --> 47:41.960
No, do you even know
what I'm talking about

47:41.960 --> 47:43.500
before you start scolding me?

47:43.500 --> 47:44.800
I just don't get it.

47:45.320 --> 47:48.030
I, Duan Qiyan,
am at least a boss to others.

47:48.420 --> 47:50.090
Why, in your eyes, Tang Tingting,

47:50.090 --> 47:51.260
am I capable

47:51.260 --> 47:52.460
of nothing?

47:52.500 --> 47:54.050
Am I that useless?

47:56.900 --> 47:59.230
Duan Qiyan, why are you getting mad at me?

48:00.110 --> 48:02.440
I shouldn't have bothered with your crap.

48:30.590 --> 48:31.550
This late again?

48:31.800 --> 48:34.200
What do you want to eat?
I'll make it for you.

48:35.360 --> 48:36.360
Actually,

48:37.170 --> 48:38.300
I'm not that hungry.

48:39.780 --> 48:40.510
Then...

48:40.590 --> 48:41.720
Just sit for a while?

49:24.160 --> 49:28.560
♪ I'm like the gentle clouds in the sky ♪

49:29.090 --> 49:30.590
I really want to try the strawberry crepes

49:29.490 --> 49:33.400
♪ Looking forward
to the stop of the night breeze ♪

49:30.590 --> 49:32.190
at that place you mentioned.

49:32.880 --> 49:34.210
Then let's go there now.

49:34.360 --> 49:35.070
Now?

49:35.020 --> 49:41.600
♪ I'm wandering about carefully,
looking for the answer, so at a loss ♪

49:35.710 --> 49:36.210
Yes.

49:36.900 --> 49:38.110
Sit tight and hold on.

49:38.320 --> 49:39.520
I'm going to speed up.

49:39.650 --> 49:42.000
Don't worry. The crepes won't get away.

49:42.840 --> 49:43.370
Let's go!

49:43.900 --> 49:45.000
Go!

49:45.580 --> 49:49.940
♪ Sometimes I wonder
if I should back down ♪

49:50.920 --> 49:54.980
♪ Sudden alienation between us
is what scares me the most ♪

49:56.160 --> 50:02.980
♪ How can two hearts beat as one
and truly feel each other? ♪

50:05.980 --> 50:15.720
[Strawberry crepes sold out]

50:07.210 --> 50:11.000
♪ The meteors fly past,
silencing thoughts ♪

50:12.980 --> 50:15.510
See? The strawberry crepes got away.

50:18.150 --> 50:19.550
We'll come back next time

50:20.210 --> 50:21.960
and catch them.

50:28.900 --> 50:30.630
It was my first time living with someone

50:30.630 --> 50:32.750
other than Dad, Mom, and Zeqiu.

50:34.150 --> 50:36.410
There was no awkwardness or discomfort,

50:37.070 --> 50:38.550
only a natural connection

50:39.110 --> 50:41.170
and happiness in every second.

50:43.010 --> 50:45.630
This feeling is so wonderful.

50:46.440 --> 50:48.300
Just like the Gaussian integral,

50:49.440 --> 50:53.110
the calculation process
is beautiful and magical,

50:53.920 --> 50:56.120
and the result is even more unexpected.

50:59.070 --> 51:01.470
The only person
who can give me this feeling

51:01.760 --> 51:03.030
is Jiang Yubai.
